Method for applying a non-woven fabric element (3) to a main body (2) of elastic fabric, comprising the following steps:
a) cutting a polypropylene non-woven fabric to form said non-woven fabric element (3);
b) positioning the non-woven fabric element (3) overlapping the main body (2);
c) thermal pressing the set of the main body (2) and non-woven fabric element (3) to apply a pressure and temperature such that a portion of the non-woven fabric element (3) melts and adheres to the main body (2).
